    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b9ad3e14216c2f08",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c4a49e0a9804dc432253a66a88ddd383bf360a00390482f53c32fcb187ef4b1e",
      "text": "Early in the morning, you’ll head to Doka Coffee Plantation.\n\nOn the tour, you’ll see the whole coffee production process, from growing and harvesting to processing and roasting. The visit ends with a coffee preparation demonstration and tasting. You can buy Costa Rican coffee at the farm.\n\nThe next stop is Poás Volcano National Park. As you climb, the temperature and vegetation change. From higher up, you can see coffee plantations and greenhouses growing flowers and strawberries.\n\nThe tour continues at La Paz Waterfall Gardens, where you’ll find tropical forest and several waterfalls.\n\nThe visit also includes a hummingbird gallery, a serpentarium, a bird garden, a butterfly farm and a frog exhibit.\n\nAfter the tour, you’ll return to Hotel el Silencio.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-dwzfy9wx77",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      }
    },
